<span id="A1.SS1.tab1.1.3.3.1.1" class="ltx_p ltx_align_right">I·G·X</span>
</span></td></tr>
<tr id="A1.SS1.tab1.1.4" class="ltx_tr">
<td id="A1.SS1.tab1.1.4.1" class="ltx_td ltx_nopad_l ltx_nopad_r ltx_align_left ltx_align_top" style="padding:-0.2pt 1.3pt;">
<span id="A1.SS1.tab1.1.4.1.1" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_align_top" style="width:8.5pt;">
<span id="A1.SS1.tab1.1.4.1.1.1" class="ltx_p">2</span>
</span></td>
<td id="A1.SS1.tab1.1.4.2" class="ltx_td ltx_nopad_l ltx_nopad_r ltx_align_left" style="padding:-0.2pt 1.3pt;">
<span id="A1.SS1.tab1.1.4.2.1" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_align_top">
<span id="A1.SS1.tab1.1.4.2.1.1" class="ltx_p ltx_align_left">After overhearing a conversation, a character suddenly understands with certainty their loved one has lived a secret life.</span>
</span></td>
<td id="A1.SS1.tab1.1.4.3" class="ltx_td ltx_nopad_l ltx_align_left ltx_align_top" style="padding:-0.2pt 1.3pt;">
<span id="A1.SS1.tab1.1.4.3.1" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_align_top" style="width:34.1pt;">
<span id="A1.SS1.tab1.1.4.3.1.1" class="ltx_p ltx_align_right">E·S·X</span>
</span></td></tr>
<tr id="A1.SS1.tab1.1.5" class="ltx_tr">
<td id="A1.SS1.tab1.1.5.1" class="ltx_td ltx_nopad_l ltx_nopad_r ltx_align_left ltx_align_top" style="padding:-0.2pt 1.3pt;">
<span id="A1.SS1.tab1.1.5.1.1" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_align_top" style="width:8.5pt;">
<span id="A1.SS1.tab1.1.5.1.1.1" class="ltx_p">3</span>
</span></td>
<td id="A1.SS1.tab1.1.5.2" class="ltx_td ltx_nopad_l ltx_nopad_r ltx_align_left" style="padding:-0.2pt 1.3pt;">
<span id="A1.SS1.tab1.1.5.2.1" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_align_top">
<span id="A1.SS1.tab1.1.5.2.1.1" class="ltx_p ltx_align_left">As memories gradually return, a character becomes aware that something they believed might be pure invention.</span>
</span></td>
<td id="A1.SS1.tab1.1.5.3" class="ltx_td ltx_nopad_l ltx_align_left ltx_align_top" style="padding:-0.2pt 1.3pt;">
