<span id="A1.SS1.tab1.1.8.1.1" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_align_top" style="width:8.5pt;">
<span id="A1.SS1.tab1.1.8.1.1.1" class="ltx_p">6</span>
</span></td>
<td id="A1.SS1.tab1.1.8.2" class="ltx_td ltx_nopad_l ltx_nopad_r ltx_align_left" style="padding:-0.2pt 1.3pt;">
<span id="A1.SS1.tab1.1.8.2.1" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_align_top">
<span id="A1.SS1.tab1.1.8.2.1.1" class="ltx_p ltx_align_left">After months of waiting, a character receives a sudden message that forces them to rethink their entire manuscript.</span>
</span></td>
<td id="A1.SS1.tab1.1.8.3" class="ltx_td ltx_nopad_l ltx_align_left ltx_align_top" style="padding:-0.2pt 1.3pt;">
