</span></td></tr>
<tr id="A1.SS1.tab1.1.12" class="ltx_tr">
<td id="A1.SS1.tab1.1.12.1" class="ltx_td ltx_nopad_l ltx_nopad_r ltx_align_left ltx_align_top" style="padding:-0.2pt 1.3pt;">
<span id="A1.SS1.tab1.1.12.1.1" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_align_top" style="width:8.5pt;">
<span id="A1.SS1.tab1.1.12.1.1.1" class="ltx_p">10</span>
</span></td>
<td id="A1.SS1.tab1.1.12.2" class="ltx_td ltx_nopad_l ltx_nopad_r ltx_align_left" style="padding:-0.2pt 1.3pt;">
<span id="A1.SS1.tab1.1.12.2.1" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_align_top">
<span id="A1.SS1.tab1.1.12.2.1.1" class="ltx_p ltx_align_left">Using magic, a character gradually feels each spell weakens their powers, though the belief never fully settles.</span>
</span></td>
<td id="A1.SS1.tab1.1.12.3" class="ltx_td ltx_nopad_l ltx_align_left ltx_align_top" style="padding:-0.2pt 1.3pt;">
