<span id="A1.SS1.tab1.1.12.3.1.1" class="ltx_p ltx_align_right">I·G·R</span>
</span></td></tr>
<tr id="A1.SS1.tab1.1.13" class="ltx_tr">
<td id="A1.SS1.tab1.1.13.1" class="ltx_td ltx_nopad_l ltx_nopad_r ltx_align_left ltx_align_top" style="padding:-0.2pt 1.3pt;" colspan="3"><span id="A1.SS1.tab1.1.13.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_italic" style="font-size:70%;">Abbr.: I/E = internal/external; G/S = gradual/sudden; X/R = irreversible/reversible</span></td></tr>
<tr id="A1.SS1.tab1.1.14" class="ltx_tr">
<td id="A1.SS1.tab1.1.14.1" class="ltx_td ltx_nopad_l ltx_nopad_r ltx_align_left ltx_align_top ltx_border_t" style="padding:-0.2pt 1.3pt;" colspan="3"><span id="A1.SS1.tab1.1.14.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold ltx_font_italic">Reorientation</span></td></tr>
<tr id="A1.SS1.tab1.1.15" class="ltx_tr">
<td id="A1.SS1.tab1.1.15.1" class="ltx_td ltx_nopad_l ltx_nopad_r ltx_align_left ltx_align_top" style="padding:-0.2pt 1.3pt;">
<span id="A1.SS1.tab1.1.15.1.1" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_align_top" style="width:8.5pt;">
<span id="A1.SS1.tab1.1.15.1.1.1" class="ltx_p">11</span>
</span></td>
<td id="A1.SS1.tab1.1.15.2" class="ltx_td ltx_nopad_l ltx_nopad_r ltx_align_left" style="padding:-0.2pt 1.3pt;">
<span id="A1.SS1.tab1.1.15.2.1" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_align_top">
<span id="A1.SS1.tab1.1.15.2.1.1" class="ltx_p ltx_align_left">After years abroad, a character chooses to return home, seeking the gentle peace they once knew.</span>
</span></td>
<td id="A1.SS1.tab1.1.15.3" class="ltx_td ltx_nopad_l ltx_align_left ltx_align_top" style="padding:-0.2pt 1.3pt;">
