<span id="A1.SS2.tab1.1.10.2.1.1" class="ltx_p ltx_align_left">Write like Jeanette Winterson.</span>
</span></td>
<td id="A1.SS2.tab1.1.10.3" class="ltx_td ltx_nopad_l ltx_align_left ltx_align_top" style="padding:-0.15pt 1.1pt;">
