<span id="A1.SS3.tab1.1.3.1.1.1" class="ltx_p">1</span>
</span></td>
<td id="A1.SS3.tab1.1.3.2" class="ltx_td ltx_nopad_l ltx_nopad_r ltx_align_left" style="padding:-0.2pt 1.3pt;">
<span id="A1.SS3.tab1.1.3.2.1" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_align_top">
<span id="A1.SS3.tab1.1.3.2.1.1" class="ltx_p ltx_align_left">The protagonist is motivated by achievement but torn between high ambition and fear of failure.</span>
</span></td>
<td id="A1.SS3.tab1.1.3.3" class="ltx_td ltx_nopad_l ltx_align_left ltx_align_top" style="padding:-0.2pt 1.3pt;">
<span id="A1.SS3.tab1.1.3.3.1" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_align_top" style="width:39.8pt;">
<span id="A1.SS3.tab1.1.3.3.1.1" class="ltx_p ltx_align_right">D·CO·CF</span>
</span></td></tr>
<tr id="A1.SS3.tab1.1.4" class="ltx_tr">
<td id="A1.SS3.tab1.1.4.1" class="ltx_td ltx_nopad_l ltx_nopad_r ltx_align_left ltx_align_top" style="padding:-0.2pt 1.3pt;">
<span id="A1.SS3.tab1.1.4.1.1" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_align_top" style="width:8.5pt;">
<span id="A1.SS3.tab1.1.4.1.1.1" class="ltx_p">2</span>
</span></td>
<td id="A1.SS3.tab1.1.4.2" class="ltx_td ltx_nopad_l ltx_nopad_r ltx_align_left" style="padding:-0.2pt 1.3pt;">
<span id="A1.SS3.tab1.1.4.2.1" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_align_top">
<span id="A1.SS3.tab1.1.4.2.1.1" class="ltx_p ltx_align_left">The protagonist is motivated by autonomy, consciously chasing freedom and deliberately forging their own path.</span>
</span></td>
<td id="A1.SS3.tab1.1.4.3" class="ltx_td ltx_nopad_l ltx_align_left ltx_align_top" style="padding:-0.2pt 1.3pt;">
