<span id="A1.SS3.tab1.1.7.2.1.1" class="ltx_p ltx_align_left">The protagonist is motivated by nurturance, instinctively devoting their energy to protecting, healing and encouraging.</span>
</span></td>
<td id="A1.SS3.tab1.1.7.3" class="ltx_td ltx_nopad_l ltx_align_left ltx_align_top" style="padding:-0.2pt 1.3pt;">
