<span id="A1.SS3.tab1.1.9.2.1" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_align_top">
<span id="A1.SS3.tab1.1.9.2.1.1" class="ltx_p ltx_align_left">The protagonist is motivated by recognition, fully aware that they thrive on applause and headlines.</span>
</span></td>
<td id="A1.SS3.tab1.1.9.3" class="ltx_td ltx_nopad_l ltx_align_left ltx_align_top" style="padding:-0.2pt 1.3pt;">
