<span id="A1.SS3.tab1.1.13.1.1" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_align_top" style="width:455.2pt;">
<span id="A1.SS3.tab1.1.13.1.1.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A1.SS3.tab1.1.13.1.1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_italic" style="font-size:70%;">Abbr.: D/C = destructive/constructive; CO/U = conscious/unconscious; CF/F = conflicted/focused</span></span>
</span></td></tr>
<tr id="A1.SS3.tab1.1.14" class="ltx_tr">
<td id="A1.SS3.tab1.1.14.1" class="ltx_td ltx_nopad_l ltx_nopad_r ltx_align_left ltx_align_top ltx_border_t" style="padding:-0.2pt 1.3pt;" colspan="3"><span id="A1.SS3.tab1.1.14.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold ltx_font_italic">Social Status</span></td></tr>
<tr id="A1.SS3.tab1.1.15" class="ltx_tr">
<td id="A1.SS3.tab1.1.15.1" class="ltx_td ltx_nopad_l ltx_nopad_r ltx_align_left ltx_align_top" style="padding:-0.2pt 1.3pt;">
<span id="A1.SS3.tab1.1.15.1.1" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_align_top" style="width:8.5pt;">
<span id="A1.SS3.tab1.1.15.1.1.1" class="ltx_p">11</span>
</span></td>
<td id="A1.SS3.tab1.1.15.2" class="ltx_td ltx_nopad_l ltx_nopad_r ltx_align_left" style="padding:-0.2pt 1.3pt;">
<span id="A1.SS3.tab1.1.15.2.1" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_align_top">
<span id="A1.SS3.tab1.1.15.2.1.1" class="ltx_p ltx_align_left">The protagonist holds a solid status from birth due to the authority bestowed upon them.</span>
</span></td>
<td id="A1.SS3.tab1.1.15.3" class="ltx_td ltx_nopad_l ltx_align_left ltx_align_top" style="padding:-0.2pt 1.3pt;">
