<span id="A1.SS3.tab1.1.18.1.1.1" class="ltx_p">14</span>
</span></td>
<td id="A1.SS3.tab1.1.18.2" class="ltx_td ltx_nopad_l ltx_nopad_r ltx_align_left" style="padding:-0.2pt 1.3pt;">
<span id="A1.SS3.tab1.1.18.2.1" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_align_top">
<span id="A1.SS3.tab1.1.18.2.1.1" class="ltx_p ltx_align_left">The protagonist barely maintains the middle-class status they inherited, though it is unstable in society.</span>
</span></td>
<td id="A1.SS3.tab1.1.18.3" class="ltx_td ltx_nopad_l ltx_align_left ltx_align_top" style="padding:-0.2pt 1.3pt;">
