<span id="A1.SS3.tab1.1.21.1.1.1" class="ltx_p">17</span>
</span></td>
<td id="A1.SS3.tab1.1.21.2" class="ltx_td ltx_nopad_l ltx_nopad_r ltx_align_left" style="padding:-0.2pt 1.3pt;">
<span id="A1.SS3.tab1.1.21.2.1" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_align_top">
<span id="A1.SS3.tab1.1.21.2.1.1" class="ltx_p ltx_align_left">The protagonist born into poverty is bound by an unchanging reality, living the same life.</span>
</span></td>
<td id="A1.SS3.tab1.1.21.3" class="ltx_td ltx_nopad_l ltx_align_left ltx_align_top" style="padding:-0.2pt 1.3pt;">
<span id="A1.SS3.tab1.1.21.3.1" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_align_top" style="width:39.8pt;">
<span id="A1.SS3.tab1.1.21.3.1.1" class="ltx_p ltx_align_right">L·I·S</span>
</span></td></tr>
<tr id="A1.SS3.tab1.1.22" class="ltx_tr">
<td id="A1.SS3.tab1.1.22.1" class="ltx_td ltx_nopad_l ltx_nopad_r ltx_align_left ltx_align_top" style="padding:-0.2pt 1.3pt;">
<span id="A1.SS3.tab1.1.22.1.1" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_align_top" style="width:8.5pt;">
<span id="A1.SS3.tab1.1.22.1.1.1" class="ltx_p">18</span>
</span></td>
<td id="A1.SS3.tab1.1.22.2" class="ltx_td ltx_nopad_l ltx_nopad_r ltx_align_left" style="padding:-0.2pt 1.3pt;">
<span id="A1.SS3.tab1.1.22.2.1" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_align_top">
<span id="A1.SS3.tab1.1.22.2.1.1" class="ltx_p ltx_align_left">The protagonist gains attention through their talent, but their low status makes their life uncertain.</span>
</span></td>
<td id="A1.SS3.tab1.1.22.3" class="ltx_td ltx_nopad_l ltx_align_left ltx_align_top" style="padding:-0.2pt 1.3pt;">
