<span id="A1.SS3.tab1.1.24.1.1.1" class="ltx_p">20</span>
</span></td>
<td id="A1.SS3.tab1.1.24.2" class="ltx_td ltx_nopad_l ltx_nopad_r ltx_align_left" style="padding:-0.2pt 1.3pt;">
<span id="A1.SS3.tab1.1.24.2.1" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_align_top">
<span id="A1.SS3.tab1.1.24.2.1.1" class="ltx_p ltx_align_left">The protagonist seeks a future amidst an unstable life and income from a lower-class background.</span>
</span></td>
<td id="A1.SS3.tab1.1.24.3" class="ltx_td ltx_nopad_l ltx_align_left ltx_align_top" style="padding:-0.2pt 1.3pt;">
