<span id="A1.SS3.tab1.1.24.3.1.1" class="ltx_p ltx_align_right">L·I·U</span>
</span></td></tr>
<tr id="A1.SS3.tab1.1.25" class="ltx_tr">
<td id="A1.SS3.tab1.1.25.1" class="ltx_td ltx_nopad_l ltx_nopad_r ltx_align_left ltx_align_top" style="padding:-0.2pt 1.3pt;" colspan="3">
<span id="A1.SS3.tab1.1.25.1.1" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_align_top" style="width:455.2pt;">
<span id="A1.SS3.tab1.1.25.1.1.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A1.SS3.tab1.1.25.1.1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_italic" style="font-size:70%;">Abbr.: H/M/L = high/middle/low; E/I = earned/inherited; S/U = stable/unstable</span></span>
</span></td></tr>
<tr id="A1.SS3.tab1.1.26" class="ltx_tr">
<td id="A1.SS3.tab1.1.26.1" class="ltx_td ltx_nopad_l ltx_nopad_r ltx_align_left ltx_align_top ltx_border_t" style="padding:-0.2pt 1.3pt;" colspan="3"><span id="A1.SS3.tab1.1.26.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold ltx_font_italic">Relational Identity</span></td></tr>
<tr id="A1.SS3.tab1.1.27" class="ltx_tr">
<td id="A1.SS3.tab1.1.27.1" class="ltx_td ltx_nopad_l ltx_nopad_r ltx_align_left ltx_align_top" style="padding:-0.2pt 1.3pt;">
<span id="A1.SS3.tab1.1.27.1.1" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_align_top" style="width:8.5pt;">
<span id="A1.SS3.tab1.1.27.1.1.1" class="ltx_p">21</span>
</span></td>
<td id="A1.SS3.tab1.1.27.2" class="ltx_td ltx_nopad_l ltx_nopad_r ltx_align_left" style="padding:-0.2pt 1.3pt;">
<span id="A1.SS3.tab1.1.27.2.1" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_align_top">
<span id="A1.SS3.tab1.1.27.2.1.1" class="ltx_p ltx_align_left">The protagonist engages openly with others, builds trust, and forms bonds based on strong interactions.</span>
</span></td>
<td id="A1.SS3.tab1.1.27.3" class="ltx_td ltx_nopad_l ltx_align_left ltx_align_top" style="padding:-0.2pt 1.3pt;">
<span id="A1.SS3.tab1.1.27.3.1" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_align_top" style="width:39.8pt;">
<span id="A1.SS3.tab1.1.27.3.1.1" class="ltx_p ltx_align_right">C·O</span>
</span></td></tr>
<tr id="A1.SS3.tab1.1.28" class="ltx_tr">
<td id="A1.SS3.tab1.1.28.1" class="ltx_td ltx_nopad_l ltx_nopad_r ltx_align_left ltx_align_top" style="padding:-0.2pt 1.3pt;">
<span id="A1.SS3.tab1.1.28.1.1" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_align_top" style="width:8.5pt;">
<span id="A1.SS3.tab1.1.28.1.1.1" class="ltx_p">22</span>
</span></td>
<td id="A1.SS3.tab1.1.28.2" class="ltx_td ltx_nopad_l ltx_nopad_r ltx_align_left" style="padding:-0.2pt 1.3pt;">
<span id="A1.SS3.tab1.1.28.2.1" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_align_top">
<span id="A1.SS3.tab1.1.28.2.1.1" class="ltx_p ltx_align_left">The protagonist engages cooperatively and helpfully while defensively controlling the interaction to stay in control.</span>
</span></td>
<td id="A1.SS3.tab1.1.28.3" class="ltx_td ltx_nopad_l ltx_align_left ltx_align_top" style="padding:-0.2pt 1.3pt;">
<span id="A1.SS3.tab1.1.28.3.1" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_align_top" style="width:39.8pt;">
<span id="A1.SS3.tab1.1.28.3.1.1" class="ltx_p ltx_align_right">C·D</span>
</span></td></tr>
<tr id="A1.SS3.tab1.1.29" class="ltx_tr">
<td id="A1.SS3.tab1.1.29.1" class="ltx_td ltx_nopad_l ltx_nopad_r ltx_align_left ltx_align_top" style="padding:-0.2pt 1.3pt;">
<span id="A1.SS3.tab1.1.29.1.1" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_align_top" style="width:8.5pt;">
<span id="A1.SS3.tab1.1.29.1.1.1" class="ltx_p">23</span>
</span></td>
<td id="A1.SS3.tab1.1.29.2" class="ltx_td ltx_nopad_l ltx_nopad_r ltx_align_left" style="padding:-0.2pt 1.3pt;">
<span id="A1.SS3.tab1.1.29.2.1" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_align_top">
<span id="A1.SS3.tab1.1.29.2.1.1" class="ltx_p ltx_align_left">The protagonist engages quietly, distancing themselves from intimacy and preferring indirect support over deep connections.</span>
</span></td>
<td id="A1.SS3.tab1.1.29.3" class="ltx_td ltx_nopad_l ltx_align_left ltx_align_top" style="padding:-0.2pt 1.3pt;">
<span id="A1.SS3.tab1.1.29.3.1" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_align_top" style="width:39.8pt;">
<span id="A1.SS3.tab1.1.29.3.1.1" class="ltx_p ltx_align_right">C·W</span>
</span></td></tr>
<tr id="A1.SS3.tab1.1.30" class="ltx_tr">
<td id="A1.SS3.tab1.1.30.1" class="ltx_td ltx_nopad_l ltx_nopad_r ltx_align_left ltx_align_top" style="padding:-0.2pt 1.3pt;">
<span id="A1.SS3.tab1.1.30.1.1" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_align_top" style="width:8.5pt;">
<span id="A1.SS3.tab1.1.30.1.1.1" class="ltx_p">24</span>
</span></td>
<td id="A1.SS3.tab1.1.30.2" class="ltx_td ltx_nopad_l ltx_nopad_r ltx_align_left" style="padding:-0.2pt 1.3pt;">
<span id="A1.SS3.tab1.1.30.2.1" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_align_top">
<span id="A1.SS3.tab1.1.30.2.1.1" class="ltx_p ltx_align_left">The protagonist competes openly, striving to surpass others through noticeable efforts and direct, honest challenges.</span>
</span></td>
<td id="A1.SS3.tab1.1.30.3" class="ltx_td ltx_nopad_l ltx_align_left ltx_align_top" style="padding:-0.2pt 1.3pt;">
<span id="A1.SS3.tab1.1.30.3.1" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_align_top" style="width:39.8pt;">
<span id="A1.SS3.tab1.1.30.3.1.1" class="ltx_p ltx_align_right">M·O</span>
</span></td></tr>
<tr id="A1.SS3.tab1.1.31" class="ltx_tr">
<td id="A1.SS3.tab1.1.31.1" class="ltx_td ltx_nopad_l ltx_nopad_r ltx_align_left ltx_align_top" style="padding:-0.2pt 1.3pt;">
<span id="A1.SS3.tab1.1.31.1.1" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_align_top" style="width:8.5pt;">
<span id="A1.SS3.tab1.1.31.1.1.1" class="ltx_p">25</span>
</span></td>
<td id="A1.SS3.tab1.1.31.2" class="ltx_td ltx_nopad_l ltx_nopad_r ltx_align_left" style="padding:-0.2pt 1.3pt;">
<span id="A1.SS3.tab1.1.31.2.1" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_align_top">
<span id="A1.SS3.tab1.1.31.2.1.1" class="ltx_p ltx_align_left">The protagonist competes cautiously, torn between the desire to succeed and the fear of failure.</span>
</span></td>
<td id="A1.SS3.tab1.1.31.3" class="ltx_td ltx_nopad_l ltx_align_left ltx_align_top" style="padding:-0.2pt 1.3pt;">
<span id="A1.SS3.tab1.1.31.3.1" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_align_top" style="width:39.8pt;">
<span id="A1.SS3.tab1.1.31.3.1.1" class="ltx_p ltx_align_right">M·D</span>
</span></td></tr>
