<span id="A1.SS4.tab1.1.4.2.1.1" class="ltx_p ltx_align_left">Set in a time shaped by sacred knowledge, imperial networks, and slowly shifting frontiers of belief and trade.</span>
</span></td>
<td id="A1.SS4.tab1.1.4.3" class="ltx_td ltx_nopad_l ltx_nopad_r ltx_align_left ltx_align_top" style="padding:-0.2pt 1.2pt;">
