<span id="A1.SS4.tab1.1.7.2.1.1" class="ltx_p ltx_align_left">Set in a present-day or near-future world shaped by digital labor, networked lives, and algorithmic systems.</span>
</span></td>
<td id="A1.SS4.tab1.1.7.3" class="ltx_td ltx_nopad_l ltx_nopad_r ltx_align_left ltx_align_top" style="padding:-0.2pt 1.2pt;">
