<div id="A5.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="A5.p1.1" class="ltx_p">Category-level selection rate ratios vs. the within-element baseline category (pooled across models/prompts), shown side-by-side for two offsets (Offset=<math id="A5.p1.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\log K" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>log</mi><mo lspace="0.167em">⁡</mo><mi>K</mi></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\log K</annotation></semantics></math> and Offset=<math id="A5.p1.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\log K+\log n_{\mathrm{items}}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mi>log</mi><mo lspace="0.167em">⁡</mo><mi>K</mi></mrow><mo>+</mo><mrow><mi>log</mi><mo lspace="0.167em">⁡</mo><msub><mi>n</mi><mi>items</mi></msub></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\log K+\log n_{\mathrm{items}}</annotation></semantics></math>).</p>
</div>
</section>
