<div id="A6.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="A6.p1.1" class="ltx_p">Top-3 constraints per model with the largest rank divergence between creativity and non-creativity prompts,
based on the co-occurrence network (frequency-based hubs).
“Avg BQ” denotes the mean rank under basic and quality-focused prompts, while <math id="A6.p1.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\Delta" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi mathvariant="normal">Δ</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\Delta</annotation></semantics></math> measures the gap between this average and the creativity rank.
Keywords summarize each constraint.</p>
</div>
