<div id="A7.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="A7.p1.1" class="ltx_p">Top-5 <em id="A7.p1.1.1" class="ltx_emph ltx_font_italic">Over</em>- or <em id="A7.p1.1.2" class="ltx_emph ltx_font_italic">Under</em>-selected axes by system prompt. Support = number of significant constraints mapped to the axis. Enrich = observed/expected ratio, Share = axis share within direction, Global = global baseline share. Values rounded.</p>
</div>
