</figure>
<div id="A8.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="A8.p1.1" class="ltx_p">Element-level selection rate ratios relative to <span id="A8.p1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_italic">Event</span> (pooled across models and prompts), shown side-by-side for two offsets (<math id="A8.p1.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\log K" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>log</mi><mo lspace="0.167em">⁡</mo><mi>K</mi></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\log K</annotation></semantics></math> and <math id="A8.p1.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\log K+\log n_{\mathrm{items}}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mi>log</mi><mo lspace="0.167em">⁡</mo><mi>K</mi></mrow><mo>+</mo><mrow><mi>log</mi><mo lspace="0.167em">⁡</mo><msub><mi>n</mi><mi>items</mi></msub></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\log K+\log n_{\mathrm{items}}</annotation></semantics></math>). <span id="A8.p1.1.2" class="ltx_text ltx_font_italic">N runs</span> <math id="A8.p1.m3" class="ltx_Math" alttext="=2880" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mphantom></mphantom><mo>=</mo><mn>2880</mn></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">=2880</annotation></semantics></math> for all elements.</p>
</div>
</section>
