<div id="A11.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="A11.p1.1" class="ltx_p">Kruskal–Wallis global test and selected post-hoc pairwise contrasts between models. Effect sizes are reported as Kruskal’s <math id="A11.p1.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\epsilon^{2}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><msup><mi>ϵ</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\epsilon^{2}</annotation></semantics></math> <cite class="ltx_cite ltx_citemacro_citep">(<a href="#bib.bib28" title="" class="ltx_ref">Tomczak and Tomczak, 2014</a>)</cite> and Cliff’s <math id="A11.p1.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\delta" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi>δ</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\delta</annotation></semantics></math> <cite class="ltx_cite ltx_citemacro_citep">(<a href="#bib.bib8" title="" class="ltx_ref">Cliff, 1993</a>)</cite>.</p>
</div>
